WEBVTT

00:01.190 --> 00:04.660
Take over my body? What does that mean?

00:05.330 --> 00:07.530
It means exactly what it sounds like.

00:07.530 --> 00:11.280
And once Senya takes control of your body,

00:11.640 --> 00:14.040
you will die.

00:15.810 --> 00:18.620
I still don't know what the 
hell you're talking about.

00:18.620 --> 00:20.050
It doesn't even make sense.

00:20.050 --> 00:22.040
It means that you have been deceived!

00:22.380 --> 00:25.000
There's no way he'd do something like that!

00:25.000 --> 00:29.260
If you think I'm lying, 
why don't you ask him yourself?

00:30.040 --> 00:35.510
And you'd better go and tell Matakara-kun
before you run out of time!

02:11.150 --> 02:16.160
<b>#10 Fallen Friend! This Love, This Pain, This Almond Tofu!</b>

02:19.160 --> 02:22.910
Have you ever once considered 
Matakara-kun's feelings?

02:23.540 --> 02:26.030
Don't talk to me again until you have.

02:32.420 --> 02:34.340
So he didn't show.

02:34.810 --> 02:37.490
Let's try his place again on the way home.

02:39.830 --> 02:41.680
Matakara!

02:41.680 --> 02:44.700
You had us worried, you big jerk!

02:46.230 --> 02:47.470
Let's go have some fun.

02:47.470 --> 02:50.710
Oh! Nice idea! Let's go, let's go!

02:50.710 --> 02:52.380
So where to? Batting center?

02:52.380 --> 02:55.570
Nah, let's go to the arcade 
and celebrate your return!

02:55.570 --> 02:58.030
Let's go to the arcade! Come on, hurry up!

03:01.670 --> 03:02.580
Hey.

03:03.070 --> 03:04.700
Come out, Senya.

03:05.390 --> 03:07.580
There's something I want to ask you.

03:12.180 --> 03:14.140
What the hell is he doing?

03:16.430 --> 03:19.960
A special match in honor of Matakara's return,
 and I'm gonna dominate!

03:19.960 --> 03:21.050
Not if I can help it!

03:21.050 --> 03:22.430
Oh, yeah? Come on!

03:25.020 --> 03:26.180
Take that!

03:26.180 --> 03:28.190
Girls are so cold.

03:28.920 --> 03:30.960
I'll go get some drinks.

03:30.960 --> 03:31.790
Sure.

03:31.790 --> 03:33.190
I'll take a peach cider!

03:33.810 --> 03:36.680
Once they realize I'm broke, 
they won't even talk to me.

03:37.790 --> 03:39.200
Hey! Watch where you—

03:40.570 --> 03:42.950
Asamine from Minato?

03:44.050 --> 03:45.210
Let's go, man.

03:49.950 --> 03:51.130
What the hell are you doing?!

03:51.640 --> 03:55.380
He bumped into me.

03:56.170 --> 03:57.890
Why, you...

03:58.340 --> 04:00.970
<b>1 Credit 100 Yen</b>

03:59.250 --> 04:00.970
Oh, no, you don't!

04:07.400 --> 04:08.480
Matakara!

04:08.480 --> 04:12.480
Wow, you sure made a mess here.

04:13.650 --> 04:15.530
What's going on, man?

04:15.530 --> 04:16.730
What do you mean?

04:16.730 --> 04:19.990
You never used to even 
bother with the NG guys.

04:20.680 --> 04:21.980
I didn't?

04:40.650 --> 04:42.150
Welcome in!

04:42.790 --> 04:44.610
The usual today?

04:44.610 --> 04:45.920
Jasmine-chan, please.

04:45.920 --> 04:49.950
Yes! Jasmine-chan! Wait...

04:49.950 --> 04:52.900
Oh, oops. She's with a customer right now.

04:53.730 --> 04:55.850
Th-Then I'll wait!

04:55.850 --> 04:58.250
Oh, she's actually booked all day.

04:58.250 --> 04:59.900
I'm sorry, sir.

05:00.190 --> 05:02.280
She's what?!

05:02.660 --> 05:07.790
This is more like it. But random 
guys like that won't cut it.

05:08.550 --> 05:09.910
Then how about them?

05:20.270 --> 05:22.540
You got a problem?

05:22.990 --> 05:24.930
Yeah, but it isn't with you.

05:24.930 --> 05:26.240
Huh?

05:34.340 --> 05:35.360
Aw, what's this?

05:35.700 --> 05:39.610
You want some attention? 
Like a little doggie?

05:41.740 --> 05:46.450
I heard you were down in the dumps, 
but you seem okay to me.

05:46.450 --> 05:49.790
I guess I could play with you a bit.

06:00.430 --> 06:01.300
Hup.

06:01.300 --> 06:03.110
Hup. A-hup.

06:04.800 --> 06:05.790
Bam!

06:12.940 --> 06:14.270
Withdraw for now.

06:14.610 --> 06:15.520
But I...

06:15.900 --> 06:18.400
You aren't ready to fight him yet.

06:19.720 --> 06:22.560
Oh? Wha happun?

06:24.410 --> 06:25.740
Matakara, you asshole!

06:25.740 --> 06:28.560
Jaba-chan.

06:28.920 --> 06:31.270
That one's mine, okay?

06:31.270 --> 06:32.750
Sorry 'bout that.

06:32.750 --> 06:36.880
Check this out! Lookin' good!

06:36.880 --> 06:40.120
Hey. I know you can hear me, Senya.

06:43.060 --> 06:44.900
Shindo, you know...

06:44.900 --> 06:47.770
He said some stuff about 
you taking over my body.

06:49.110 --> 06:50.870
Pretty crazy, huh?

06:52.630 --> 06:56.010
So, would you come on out?

06:57.160 --> 06:58.480
Arajin.

06:58.480 --> 07:00.210
Quit spying on me!

07:00.210 --> 07:03.230
Did you say someone's taken over your body?

07:03.230 --> 07:05.650
N-No, that was...

07:05.970 --> 07:07.850
It's all right, Arajin.

07:07.850 --> 07:11.490
When you fall in love, you have 
to surrender your body and soul.

07:11.490 --> 07:13.230
That's what love is!

07:13.690 --> 07:16.290
Just like how your father 
took your mother and...

07:16.750 --> 07:18.170
Oh, my!

07:18.170 --> 07:19.560
Get out, you hag!

07:19.560 --> 07:20.380
Aw!

07:23.600 --> 07:29.390
Anyway, that stuff about you 
trying to kill me is all a lie, right?

07:30.030 --> 07:31.150
Senya?

07:34.350 --> 07:36.010
Why did you stop me?

07:36.610 --> 07:38.740
You can't beat him yet.

07:39.290 --> 07:43.360
And if you lose now, you'll live 
in fear of that thing forever.

08:05.370 --> 08:07.760
Matakara has been acting 
real strange recently.

08:07.760 --> 08:11.510
<b>Sincerity</b>

08:07.760 --> 08:11.510
<b>Waves</b>

08:08.450 --> 08:11.510
He keeps picking fights with NG and Siguma.

08:12.140 --> 08:16.480
The way he's doing it isn't like him at all.

08:18.980 --> 08:23.610
I don't know what to do, Ken-san, so I...

08:24.980 --> 08:28.240
<b>Bring

Him

Here</b>

08:37.330 --> 08:40.450
Wait. Why aren't you fighting him?

08:40.910 --> 08:45.090
What would be the point? 
It has to be someone stronger.

08:48.190 --> 08:50.260
No, you will fight him.

08:52.120 --> 08:54.630
You want to eliminate 
the monster, don't you?

08:58.380 --> 08:59.650
Matakara?

09:02.090 --> 09:05.560
You've sure been showing off, haven't you?

09:06.200 --> 09:07.800
Say something to me!

09:09.540 --> 09:11.240
If you're scared, you should run.

09:12.250 --> 09:13.890
How could I run

09:14.900 --> 09:18.580
after you've beaten up 
so many of my friends?!

09:30.200 --> 09:31.430
Not yet.

09:32.290 --> 09:34.500
Damn it.

09:36.370 --> 09:39.770
We aren't finished here yet!

09:41.080 --> 09:42.340
Do it.

09:42.340 --> 09:45.020
Isn't that enough? He's already down!

09:45.020 --> 09:48.530
You must become more ruthless.

09:49.080 --> 09:51.560
Abandon your cowardly heart.

10:00.540 --> 10:05.040
<b>Ice Candy</b>

10:00.540 --> 10:05.040
<b>Gashigashi-kun</b>

10:01.650 --> 10:05.040
He's good at janken, 
but he sure sucks at fighting.

10:05.470 --> 10:08.970
Let's see. He always goes 
for mint chocolate chip.

10:09.970 --> 10:11.970
That was hard to watch, huh?

10:11.970 --> 10:14.010
Yeah, he was about to get killed.

10:14.010 --> 10:17.400
But why Hagure from Siguma?

10:25.480 --> 10:28.610
Matakara!

10:33.450 --> 10:35.070
You're dead now!

10:46.050 --> 10:48.760
You're going to lose to a weakling like that?

10:49.490 --> 10:52.710
Then that monster's going 
to keep torturing you.

10:52.710 --> 10:54.990
Is that what you want?

11:03.480 --> 11:04.690
Come on!

11:11.720 --> 11:13.080
Damn it!

11:27.310 --> 11:29.000
Please stop!

11:41.010 --> 11:44.670
I heard Matakara left Hagure 
and Jabashiri half-dead.

11:44.670 --> 11:47.320
He kept kicking them even 
after they couldn't get up.

11:47.320 --> 11:48.940
You mean <i>that</i> Matakara?

11:48.940 --> 11:50.400
You've gotta be kidding.

11:51.010 --> 11:54.440
<i>There's no way he'd do something like that.</i>

11:55.240 --> 11:57.810
Are you sure you don't need the hospital?

11:59.880 --> 12:01.690
Come on, you should go.

12:04.760 --> 12:06.760
Fine. I'll come back later.

12:08.670 --> 12:10.900
I thought I'd be able to beat him this time.

12:12.890 --> 12:15.430
But... now...

12:17.030 --> 12:18.280
Ryu-chan...

12:19.600 --> 12:21.010
Ta-da!

12:21.010 --> 12:22.260
Marito-kun!

12:22.660 --> 12:25.840
You sure look like a mess. 
How are you feeling?

12:26.830 --> 12:28.520
Just stay in bed.

12:29.400 --> 12:32.930
Matakara... The fight was over, 
but he kept going after Ryu-chan...

12:32.930 --> 12:34.520
Would you keep your mouth shu—

12:35.280 --> 12:36.940
Jaba-chan.

12:37.600 --> 12:41.390
I told you Matakara was mine, didn't I?

12:41.780 --> 12:43.000
Sorry 'bout that.

12:48.420 --> 12:50.080
Get some rest, okay?

12:51.050 --> 12:52.290
Thanks.

13:02.270 --> 13:07.100
In the past, Jabashiri and Matakara 
always seemed pretty evenly matched.

13:07.570 --> 13:08.770
But now...

13:10.930 --> 13:15.160
I don't think you should fight him. 
I've got a bad feeling about this.

13:17.030 --> 13:20.750
And your intuition is usually spot-on.

13:21.720 --> 13:23.870
So that means...

13:26.150 --> 13:28.710
I have some excitement to look forward to.

13:32.930 --> 13:34.630
Matakara...

13:34.630 --> 13:36.770
This isn't like you, man!

13:39.330 --> 13:40.630
Matakara!

13:45.000 --> 13:46.790
What the hell is wrong with you?

13:47.230 --> 13:48.390
Wrong?

13:48.390 --> 13:51.900
This isn't like you at all!

13:52.390 --> 13:54.020
Then what <i>is</i> like me?

13:55.790 --> 13:58.090
What makes you think you know me, Zabu?

13:59.650 --> 14:02.210
Hey, that's no way to talk to him!

14:02.210 --> 14:05.970
Zabu's been worried about you this 
whole time! What the hell, man?!

14:05.970 --> 14:08.410
I'm only trying to get stronger.

14:08.410 --> 14:09.980
Matakara!

14:11.200 --> 14:13.920
Come on. Ken-san wants to see you.

14:15.280 --> 14:17.050
I'll save him for last.

14:17.420 --> 14:19.580
Hey! What does that m—

14:19.580 --> 14:22.170
<i>Ding, dong, ding, dong!</i>

14:22.490 --> 14:24.450
<i>Hey! Test, test!</i>

14:24.450 --> 14:26.780
<i>This is a microphone test.</i>

14:26.780 --> 14:29.430
<i>Today is super clear and sunny!</i>

14:29.980 --> 14:33.770
<i>Matakara-chan! Can you hear me?</i>

14:34.190 --> 14:37.690
<i>Please come to the field immediately.</i>

14:38.110 --> 14:41.190
<i>Come out and play! With! Me!</i>

14:41.800 --> 14:45.030
<i>This announcement was 
brought to you by Marito-kun.</i>

14:48.000 --> 14:50.040
Marito and Matakara are gonna fight!

14:50.040 --> 14:51.910
This is gonna be awesome!

14:50.040 --> 14:52.710
Um, fellas?

14:52.710 --> 14:53.650
Let's go!

14:53.650 --> 14:56.090
Class is still in session!

14:59.840 --> 15:01.670
Tomoshibi-kun!

15:02.550 --> 15:05.030
Well, then, shall we continue the lesson?

15:06.540 --> 15:08.480
You've still got two years until exams,

15:08.480 --> 15:11.220
but if you start slacking off now, 
you'll run out of time.

15:12.930 --> 15:18.480
And you'd better go and tell Matakara-kun 
before you run out of time!

15:20.780 --> 15:22.610
T-Tomoshibi-kun?

15:23.670 --> 15:25.240
Who do you think is gonna win?

15:25.240 --> 15:27.990
Huh? Marito, no question.

15:27.990 --> 15:32.240
Matakara nearly killed those Siguma guys. 
Marito might be in trouble.

15:34.290 --> 15:34.870
Huh?

15:38.950 --> 15:42.790
Jeez. There's no way my brother's gonna lose.

15:42.790 --> 15:44.240
Stupid randos.

16:00.440 --> 16:02.230
Hey! Out of my way!

16:17.980 --> 16:19.500
He blocked it!

16:19.500 --> 16:20.870
Oh, yeah?

16:21.430 --> 16:24.250
Then I won't hold back.

16:39.770 --> 16:42.520
Who does that blockhead think he is, anyway?

16:42.520 --> 16:46.190
Why is he toying with him? 
Marito, you idiot!

16:47.320 --> 16:49.530
I mean, Marito-kun, fight!

16:51.990 --> 16:53.070
<i>He's open!</i>

17:06.550 --> 17:11.300
Hey, doggie! Here, boy! Let's play some more!

17:11.750 --> 17:14.550
<i>I didn't think he'd go this far.</i>

17:21.770 --> 17:23.560
Oh, dear. That all you got?

17:38.440 --> 17:39.910
Matakara!

17:40.390 --> 17:42.560
Matakara totally sucks.

17:42.560 --> 17:44.560
The fight's already over.

17:44.560 --> 17:47.180
He was never gonna beat Marito.

17:47.180 --> 17:49.400
How boring.

17:50.060 --> 17:52.530
<i>So he's reached his limit after all.</i>

17:52.530 --> 17:56.360
<i>I'll never be able to use him 
to settle things with Senya.</i>

17:57.160 --> 18:00.490
Ew, I ate dirt.

18:02.450 --> 18:03.960
<i>Matakara!</i>

18:05.410 --> 18:06.940
Hey!

18:08.160 --> 18:10.530
Keep coming at me!

18:11.110 --> 18:14.580
I haven't had my fill yet!

18:20.200 --> 18:22.040
Now for the finish.

18:23.170 --> 18:24.440
No more.

18:25.270 --> 18:29.090
I don't want to anymore.

18:31.750 --> 18:40.310
I don't want to live in fear 
of that thing anymore!

18:44.370 --> 18:46.020
Now, say it!

18:46.730 --> 18:49.570
Tell me your wish!

18:54.590 --> 18:58.560
Give me power.

19:00.980 --> 19:03.200
Bucchigiri!

19:35.480 --> 19:37.440
Exci-meh... uh...

19:37.440 --> 19:38.280
Huh?

19:51.430 --> 19:52.750
Big Brother!

19:53.940 --> 19:57.630
Let go! Let go of me!

20:02.590 --> 20:05.900
<i>Huh? I can't move.</i>

20:05.900 --> 20:08.020
<i>What is this?</i>

20:12.580 --> 20:16.780
<i>Is this what losing feels like?</i>

20:47.160 --> 20:48.490
Matakara...

20:52.760 --> 20:55.410
Senya! Hey, Senya!

20:55.800 --> 20:59.800
Get your ass out here! 
What's happening to Matakara?

21:00.150 --> 21:02.290
Answer me, Senya!

22:47.460 --> 22:50.010
Yes! Thirty in a row!

22:50.010 --> 22:52.120
Minato is unbeatable!

22:52.120 --> 22:54.690
We've finally made it to the top!

22:59.520 --> 23:02.190
I'm gonna quit school to work.

23:05.100 --> 23:07.620
I'm going to rent an apartment with Matakara.

23:08.490 --> 23:12.450
I also want to try to send him to college.

23:15.720 --> 23:19.940
Kenichiro, I'm leaving Minato in your hands.

23:22.450 --> 23:23.970
Understood.

23:24.970 --> 23:26.220
One more thing.

23:27.090 --> 23:30.720
If anything happens to me, 
take care of Matakara.

23:38.020 --> 23:39.090
Ken-san!

23:39.090 --> 23:40.980
Matakara beat Marito!

23:44.990 --> 23:49.990
<b>Unanswered Wishes!</b>

23:44.990 --> 23:49.990
<b>Sudden Crab Fried Rice</b>

23:45.810 --> 23:48.000
Bucchigi-you again next week!
